{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12101170","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12101170","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1210117001:1":{"text":"엄청나게 높은 성벽이네요...! 여긴 어디죠?","source_cn":"好高大的城墙……！这里是什么地方？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80D78B505FAA3991","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1210117002:0":{"text":"... 여기가 어딘지 모르는 거야?","source_cn":"……你们不知道？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFBA523F11B90A32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1210117002":{"text":"... 여기가 어딘지 모르는 거야?","source_cn":"……你们不知道？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFBA523F11B90A32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1210117003:0":{"text":"여긴 <style=\"highlight\">러스트 항</style>이야.","source_cn":"这地方是<style=highlight>锈锚港</s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBECC82947ACCC3D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1210117004:1":{"text":"대단한데, 아무런 사전 조사도 없이 무작정 배를 타고 왔단 말이야?","source_cn":"厉害啊，你们几个，什么都不知道就开着船闯过来了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCCEC13524A6F957","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210117005:0":{"text":"원래 저희는 시더 마을로 가서 축제에 참석하려고 했어요. 그런데 항해하던 도중에 갑자기 안개가 끼더니, 배가 커다란 촉수에 뒤집히고 말았죠!","source_cn":"我们本来准备去雪松镇参加庆典，但是航行的时候，突然起了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BCCE7B81A574016","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1210117006:0":{"text":"그 얘길 들으니 이제야 이해가 되네. 그럼 그렇지, 이 <style=\"highlight\">안개</style>를 뚫고 올 수 있는 사람은 없다고...","source_cn":"到这里我就听懂了。这才对劲，怎么可能有人能穿过这<st...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9AA6CFCD6C673C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1210117007:1":{"text":"치피, 치피가 성 안에 있을까요?","source_cn":"满满，满满会在城里吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x392B6E11B1716113","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1210117008:0":{"text":"찾아봐야 알겠지. 성 안에도 항구가 여러 개 있어. <style=\"highlight\">트레밀레우스</style>의 가호가 있기를 바라야지.","source_cn":"找找才知道，城里有好几个码头。希望<style=hig...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D013B53757FDD3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1210117009:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">트레밀레우스</style>가 누군데요?","source_cn":"<style=highlight>特勒米琉斯</sty...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA03905C000299B39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1210117010:1":{"text":"그것도 몰라? 하긴, 너희는 외지인이니까.","source_cn":"你们不知道？也是，毕竟是外乡人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF98EB3B1703073C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1210117011:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">트레밀레우스</style>가 바로 파도와 표류의 신이야. 우리는 바다로 먹고사는 사람들이라, 모두들 그를 믿지.","source_cn":"<style=highlight>特勒米琉斯</sty...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74A5C20DBBF0C8A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1210117012:0":{"text":"그렇군요. 제발 치피가 무사하기를...!","source_cn":"原来是这样。希望满满能平安……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABB6D47A7783485F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:0:1":{"text":"모르겠어","source_cn":"不知道","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD5580655A74225AD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"모르겠어","female":"모르겠어","variant_male_record_index":"64814","variant_female_record_index":"64815","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:1:2":{"text":"우리가 알아야 해?","source_cn":"我们应该知道吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x92020CB4DA5C83E9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"우리가 알아야 해?","female":"우리가 알아야 해?","variant_male_record_index":"64816","variant_female_record_index":"64817","document_title":"","document_